    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "Welcome to &quot;The Way Home: A Typing Adventure&quot;, a thrilling game that challenges your typing skills as you help Emily find her way back home.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn this exciting game, you'll guide Emily through a treacherous landscape filled with monsters and typing puzzles. Create a path for Emily by typing words to construct a bridge of blocks, and use your wits to help her battle fierce enemies and overcome obstacles.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n&quot;The Way Home&quot; offers four different difficulty levels, so whether you're a typing novice or a seasoned pro, there's a challenge waiting for you. With each level, the game becomes more challenging, and you'll need to type faster and more accurately to succeed.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nImmerse yourself in a captivating world full of mystery and wonder that will keep you engaged for hours. And with the added challenge of collecting runes to power up your attacks, you'll be on the edge of your seat as you progress through the game.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAre you ready to put your typing skills to the test and help Emily find her way home? Join us on this exciting adventure today!",
    "about_the_game": "Welcome to &quot;The Way Home: A Typing Adventure&quot;, a thrilling game that challenges your typing skills as you help Emily find her way back home.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn this exciting game, you'll guide Emily through a treacherous landscape filled with monsters and typing puzzles. Create a path for Emily by typing words to construct a bridge of blocks, and use your wits to help her battle fierce enemies and overcome obstacles.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n&quot;The Way Home&quot; offers four different difficulty levels, so whether you're a typing novice or a seasoned pro, there's a challenge waiting for you. With each level, the game becomes more challenging, and you'll need to type faster and more accurately to succeed.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nImmerse yourself in a captivating world full of mystery and wonder that will keep you engaged for hours. And with the added challenge of collecting runes to power up your attacks, you'll be on the edge of your seat as you progress through the game.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAre you ready to put your typing skills to the test and help Emily find her way home? Join us on this exciting adventure today!",
    "short_description": "Type your way through monsters and obstacles to help Emily find her way home in 'The Way Home: A Typing Adventure'. With four difficulty levels and powerful rune attacks, this game tests your typing skills in a captivating world of mystery and wonder.",
